#: ../../07-conventions.md:39 e4228fc7060f4f1382f83b4347ce4608
msgid "07. Conventions"
msgstr "07. 开发规范"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:43 0af46e48da4c4e42b3924630c5e50c6c
msgid ""
"Lua code that runs inside OpenResty/ngx_lua follows Nginx-style "
"configuration on the deployment side and the Lua/OpenResty conventions "
"summarised here on the code side. The DNS-failure caller rules below are "
"verified against the nginx 1.31.1 / ngx_lua 0.10.31rc5 code in this tree; "
"the style, cosocket, and config guidance follows the API7 OpenResty coding "
"style guide, the API7 cosocket guide, the OpenResty FAQ, and the `lua-nginx-"
"module` README."
msgstr ""
"运行在 OpenResty/ngx_lua 中的 Lua 代码，在部署端遵循 Nginx 风格配置，在代码端遵循本文总结的 Lua/OpenResty "
"约定。下面的 DNS 失败调用方规则已对照本源码树中 nginx 1.31.1 / ngx_lua 0.10.31rc5 "
"的代码核实；风格、cosocket 与配置指引则参考 API7 OpenResty 编码风格指南、API7 cosocket 指南、OpenResty "
"FAQ 以及 `lua-nginx-module` README。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:50 3ed455773d6a430a826a7e1ccd27e69c
msgid "Style and Tooling"
msgstr "风格与工具"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:52 f535a6366dd042cd9a9fec6c496d8de9
msgid "**Indentation**: 4 spaces. No tabs."
msgstr "**缩进**：4 个空格，不使用制表符。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:53 f9cd4506509e40c59a2e5bb561271af3
msgid "**Spacing**: one space on both sides of operators (`local i = 1`)."
msgstr "**空格**：运算符两侧各留一个空格（`local i = 1`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:54 c98a36c4520241c5b7549b01605cb8a6
msgid "**No trailing semicolons**; keep statements on their own lines."
msgstr "**不写行尾分号**；每条语句独占一行。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:55 05e50999689549ebbe4a550faef3262e
msgid ""
"**Blank lines**: separate functions with two blank lines; separate "
"`if`/`elseif` branches with one."
msgstr "**空行**：函数之间用两个空行分隔；`if`/`elseif` 分支之间用一个空行分隔。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:57 0886fc05edeb47efb58cc683a88a74b1
msgid ""
"**Line length**: keep lines under ~80 characters; wrap and align "
"continuation lines under the opening parenthesis."
msgstr "**行长**：每行控制在约 80 字符以内；换行时在新行开头对齐到左括号之后。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:59 800cb7eb698148868bf391e23fe41354
msgid "**Detect style automatically**: run `luacheck` and `lj-releng` in CI:"
msgstr "**自动检查风格**：在 CI 中运行 `luacheck` 和 `lj-releng`："

#: ../../07-conventions.md:64 073f0f754c4842fbb7771c970f456861
msgid ""
"**Localize everything**: `local ngx = ngx`, `local require = require`, and "
"`local timer_at = ngx.timer.at` before use; cache heavily used library "
"functions in locals."
msgstr ""
"**全部本地化**：使用前先 `local ngx = ngx`、`local require = require`、`local timer_at ="
" ngx.timer.at`；把高频调用的库函数缓存在局部变量中。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:68 defd976ef02245cc80f86d57bf43aa8a
msgid "Naming and Layout"
msgstr "命名与布局"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:70 7d1cf58d1e79427493ac9a0d02e8c31b
msgid "**Variables and functions**: `snake_case`. Constants: `ALL_CAPS`."
msgstr "**变量与函数**：使用 `snake_case`。常量：全部大写（`ALL_CAPS`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:71 a50d7c9856234855b1a017dfc318244b
msgid ""
"**Modules**: one conceptual module per file; always load with the local "
"form: `local foo = require(\"foo\")` (never a bare `require(\"foo\")` - the "
"bare call leaks a global that is cleared at the end of the request)."
msgstr ""
"**模块**：每个文件一个概念模块；始终用局部形式加载：`local foo = require(\"foo\")`（绝不要裸调用 "
"`require(\"foo\")` —— 裸调用会泄漏一个在请求结束时被清空的全局变量）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:74 c0321cc1a25a4dd083f41d11afda1589
msgid ""
"**Tables**: pre-allocate with `local new_tab = require(\"table.new\"); local"
" t = new_tab(100, 0)` for large tables. Never store `nil` in an array; use "
"`ngx.null` when a JSON \"null\" is intended."
msgstr ""
"**表**：对大表使用 `local new_tab = require(\"table.new\"); local t = new_tab(100, "
"0)` 预分配。绝不要在数组中存放 `nil`；需要 JSON 的 \"null\" 时使用 `ngx.null`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:78 14c3138242774234b24f04321b5cb255
msgid "Error Handling"
msgstr "错误处理"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:80 52a57031ab79443c90a2d4e918d26f72
msgid ""
"Always branch on the error values that ngx_lua returns, and make your own "
"functions return `false, \"error string\"`:"
msgstr "务必对 ngx_lua 返回的错误值进行分支处理，并让自己的函数返回 `false, \"错误字符串\"`："

#: ../../07-conventions.md:91 4630822426e44f54ac94e36f3209ba0e
msgid "Classify DNS failures before choosing a status or a retry"
msgstr "在选择状态码或重试之前，先对 DNS 失败进行分类"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 3164d4104ceb4c4db716c4915a4d0b84
msgid "Lua `err` contains"
msgstr "Lua `err` 包含"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 4df4efa62ae9435dac634866ff8243e7
msgid "Suggested HTTP status"
msgstr "建议的 HTTP 状态码"

#: ../../07-conventions.md e0d2ac0d2cea4cb0a12ae5e4f351747b
msgid "Retry in this request"
msgstr "本次请求内重试"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 29c1f90847cc46d998a01bef25d8a25b
msgid "`Operation timed out`"
msgstr "`Operation timed out`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md f006e24e57f94915b2ace4aaabcdb690
msgid "504"
msgstr "504"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 391d5d993ccd4b54a5b8109e548af5a9
msgid "Yes, bounded"
msgstr "是，有上限"

#: ../../07-conventions.md efd31228f9f14bfeac6a88eb3e43da00
msgid "`Server failure`"
msgstr "`Server failure`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md ac5af814cf31441993a894b52c38fb49
#: dd229c17c2a9475ab4fe372dfe5e0146 f7e969cdf698486b8cea88231430bd66
msgid "502"
msgstr "502"

#: ../../07-conventions.md f2e21df862ed49c0a57d079a0c6c8d88
msgid "`Host not found`"
msgstr "`Host not found`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 0120b11e6dab4f21924eb80d075b8c60
msgid "No. The name is NXDOMAIN for this answer."
msgstr "否。对于该应答，此名称是 NXDOMAIN。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md cf70e2fd78b84020b5b1a01c10d619e7
msgid "`Operation refused`"
msgstr "`Operation refused`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 2d2fa211dfe34791a2c4334ae9c60223
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: ../../07-conventions.md c701ddee12414e9dab2eee1181b90707
msgid "`Format error` or `Unimplemented`"
msgstr "`Format error` 或 `Unimplemented`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 21d6163c03ca44d787c40bab9af5c8f0
msgid "`no resolver defined`"
msgstr "`no resolver defined`"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 3d03c0de3395411c88c8debc5692b57e
msgid "500"
msgstr "500"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 772c1bfaa9a64c7b81548e699e3edb2b
msgid "No. The worker configuration is wrong."
msgstr "否。worker 配置有误。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 3aa85d0d8ad34d01af5c1053b6e4d8f2
msgid "`could not be resolved` with no code"
msgstr "`could not be resolved` 且不带代码"

#: ../../07-conventions.md 43a1803c7ea8417daa21d59bdbbcb3ed
msgid "No, until the cause is known"
msgstr "否，直到原因明确为止"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:103 90ed23edb8ca4988969de85385a2c119
msgid ""
"`proxy_pass` already returns 502 for both a missing resolver and a timeout. "
"The 500 and 504 rows apply only when Lua chooses the status."
msgstr "`proxy_pass` 对缺少 resolver 和超时都返回 502。500 和 504 行仅在 Lua 自行选择状态码时适用。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:106 99d9d1e0b9964aaabe890a9a8dba0b2f
msgid "Retry rules for Lua HTTP callers:"
msgstr "Lua HTTP 调用方的重试规则："

#: ../../07-conventions.md:108 f147a2c055314e649c8cb42055c20340
msgid ""
"Cap attempts. The ingested note uses three tries with delays `0`, `0.05`, "
"and `0.2` seconds."
msgstr "限制尝试次数。所摄取的笔记使用三次尝试，延迟分别为 `0`、`0.05` 和 `0.2` 秒。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:110 a67a22814f204579933d1963ead3ebe5
msgid ""
"Stop on `Host not found`, `Operation refused`, and `no resolver defined`."
msgstr "遇到 `Host not found`、`Operation refused` 和 `no resolver defined` 时停止。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:111 1bb0e14e21f24430a4fa4be42e4ca31e
msgid ""
"Keep the attempt counter on the current request. Do not store it in a shared"
" dict across requests."
msgstr "将尝试计数器保存在当前请求上。不要存放在跨请求共享的字典中。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:113 0b772780a75040d6a62146adabf2d826
msgid ""
"Set a connect timeout on the cosocket so a DNS timeout is not the only "
"deadline."
msgstr "在 cosocket 上设置连接超时，使 DNS 超时不成为唯一的期限。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:115 f3d008182baa4d7bb48482b160b00bfa
msgid ""
"Connecting by a resolved address requires the original hostname on the "
"`Host` header and on TLS SNI. Verifying a certificate against the bare IP "
"will fail."
msgstr "通过解析后的地址连接时，`Host` 头和 TLS SNI 上需要保留原始主机名。对照裸 IP 校验证书会失败。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:118 db54ce0d03b6404c8a9451f3087b9159
msgid "Cosockets and Connection Pools"
msgstr "Cosocket 与连接池"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:120 f4e2c9a7d1eb419c956c9c79cf665aa3
msgid ""
"Cosockets are the sanctioned way to talk to backends from Lua; use them "
"instead of `ngx.location.capture` where a `lua-resty-*` library fits."
msgstr ""
"Cosocket 是从 Lua 访问后端的推荐方式；只要某个 `lua-resty-*` 库适用，就用它而不是 "
"`ngx.location.capture`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:123 1d248d80563d441a9e54cdef66571bd6
msgid ""
"**Create one cosocket per request** (`ngx.socket.tcp()`). A cosocket has "
"exactly the lifetime of the handler that created it - never share it across "
"requests or pass it into `ngx.timer.*` callbacks."
msgstr ""
"**每个请求创建一个 cosocket**（`ngx.socket.tcp()`）。cosocket "
"的生命周期与创建它的处理器完全一致——绝不能跨请求共享，也不能传入 `ngx.timer.*` 回调。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:126 2c36723d77644bddaab2514214c54090
msgid ""
"**Set timeouts before I/O**, separately for connect, send, and read with "
"`settimeout(ms)` or `settimeouts(connect_ms, send_ms, read_ms)`:"
msgstr ""
"**I/O 之前设置超时**，用 `settimeout(ms)` 或 `settimeouts(connect_ms, send_ms, "
"read_ms)` 分别为连接、发送和读取设置："

#: ../../07-conventions.md:132 e23a1bf4458f4fd785e169bbe8c0722d
msgid ""
"**Return idle connections to the pool** with `sock:setkeepalive()` instead "
"of closing them; the pool is chosen by the destination address and optional "
"`pool` name."
msgstr ""
"**用 `sock:setkeepalive()` 把空闲连接归还连接池**，而不是关闭它们；连接池按目标地址和可选的 `pool` 名称选择。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:135 94372e02cd734ed8952ec28742a70917
msgid ""
"**Default tuning knobs** (nginx.conf): `lua_socket_connect_timeout`, "
"`lua_socket_send_timeout`, `lua_socket_read_timeout` (all default 60 s), "
"`lua_socket_pool_size` (default 30), and `lua_socket_keepalive_timeout` "
"(default 60 s)."
msgstr ""
"**默认调优参数**（nginx.conf）：`lua_socket_connect_timeout`、`lua_socket_send_timeout`、`lua_socket_read_timeout`（均默认"
" 60 秒）、`lua_socket_pool_size`（默认 30）、`lua_socket_keepalive_timeout`（默认 60 "
"秒）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:139 ad7cff064e5a48539416e85235eaf11b
msgid ""
"**Full duplex is allowed**: a reader and a writer light thread may operate "
"on the same cosocket, but two light threads must not both read (or write, or"
" connect) it at once."
msgstr ""
"**允许全双工**：一个读 light thread 和一个写 light thread 可以同时操作同一个 cosocket，但两个 light "
"thread 不能同时读（或写、或连接）它。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:143 85e9b5255d3145ecb55c50942866b9d0
msgid "Configuration and Secrets"
msgstr "配置与密钥"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:145 002471da735146e2a7ad8b55a893b12a
msgid ""
"Recommended `http` settings for the DNS path. Confirm the addresses for each"
" environment before use."
msgstr "DNS 路径建议的 `http` 配置。使用前请确认各环境的地址。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:158 6dc8b89d66794f8d85a002ec82148bb4
msgid "Declare `resolver`. Without it, hostname connects fail immediately."
msgstr "声明 `resolver`。没有它，主机名连接会立即失败。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:159 380e8558ce4d4a7b987335d6cf515109
msgid ""
"Use at least two nameservers so a missing UDP reply can move on. A SERVFAIL "
"answer does not move on."
msgstr "至少使用两个域名服务器，以便在缺少 UDP 应答时继续。SERVFAIL 应答不会继续。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:161 3c10b9225de449a48fc2f1d88f9c10a2
msgid ""
"`valid=30s` caps how long a successful answer is kept. The code default is "
"the record TTL when `valid` is omitted."
msgstr "`valid=30s` 限制成功应答的保留时长。省略 `valid` 时代码默认使用记录 TTL。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:163 e7fbe4f43b2c4a07be85ccbf6e1ddebb
msgid ""
"`ipv6=off` skips AAAA when the network has no IPv6 path. The resolver "
"default is IPv6 on."
msgstr "当网络没有 IPv6 路径时，`ipv6=off` 跳过 AAAA。解析器默认开启 IPv6。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:165 7bdc047a6ef14ceeb33a1a326805b834
msgid ""
"`resolver_timeout 5s` replaces the 30 second default. The 5 second resend "
"interval is compiled in and is a different timer."
msgstr "`resolver_timeout 5s` 替换 30 秒默认值。5 秒重发间隔是编译进来的，属于不同的定时器。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:167 041079e177924ae89c78d5e8f0ea9aad
msgid ""
"Keep cosocket keepalive shorter than `valid` when backends change address. A"
" pooled connection keeps the old address after DNS changes."
msgstr "当后端地址会变化时，让 cosocket keepalive 短于 `valid`。连接池中的连接在 DNS 变化后仍保留旧地址。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:169 ec4b71a6a36a499c8ef8a14bf3d22cca
msgid ""
"`lua_socket_log_errors off` avoids a second error-log line after Lua has "
"already handled the cosocket error (the directive defaults to `on`)."
msgstr ""
"`lua_socket_log_errors off` 可避免在 Lua 已处理 cosocket 错误后再多记一行错误日志（该指令默认为 `on`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:171 8b595c3fd075476f832c4190ab005e26
msgid ""
"Never put credentials in Lua source. Keep tokens in environment variables "
"listed in the `env` directive, or in a secrets store, and load them at start"
" with `init_by_lua*`."
msgstr ""
"绝不要把凭据写进 Lua 源码。把 token 放在 `env` 指令列出的环境变量或密钥存储中，并在启动时用 `init_by_lua*` 加载。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:175 26d4575cdc69431a8c9f74d67a2c3741
msgid "Testing and Review Expectations"
msgstr "测试与评审预期"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:177 9da21fc0311c45d69d45d3fd73d3931d
msgid "Require a linter/CI gate: `luacheck -q lua` and `lj-releng lua/*.lua`."
msgstr "要求 lint/CI 关卡：`luacheck -q lua` 和 `lj-releng lua/*.lua`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:178 c946d5fd790b4dc7a8913a05a7359dfa
msgid ""
"When changing `ngx_resolver.c` or the cosocket resolve handler, cover: "
"missing resolver, NXDOMAIN, timeout, and a CNAME chain that hits "
"`NGX_RESOLVER_MAX_RECURSION`."
msgstr ""
"更改 `ngx_resolver.c` 或 cosocket 解析处理器时，覆盖：缺少 resolver、NXDOMAIN、超时，以及命中 "
"`NGX_RESOLVER_MAX_RECURSION` 的 CNAME 链。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:181 437b7d6988a14d4696db61f560e4d8a5
msgid ""
"Add a paired success and failure test for each new cosocket path (happy path"
" plus timeout / `Connection refused` / `Host not found`)."
msgstr ""
"为每条新的 cosocket 路径成对添加成功与失败测试（正常路径加超时 / `Connection refused` / `Host not "
"found`）。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:184 3add5fa58cd246d493d5a00330be122f
msgid "Anti-Patterns"
msgstr "反模式"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:186 df5d6f9be8c946c98ba4aec5cf927d18
msgid "Using global variables or a bare `require(\"x\")` at module top level."
msgstr "在模块顶层使用全局变量或裸调用 `require(\"x\")`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:187 2e71486169ab4dc5b61a142defd1872d
msgid ""
"Calling `getaddrinfo`, shelling out to `dig`, or any blocking call (`io.*`, "
"`os.execute`, plain LuaSocket) inside a request - it stalls every request on"
" that worker."
msgstr ""
"在请求内调用 `getaddrinfo`、通过 shell 调用 `dig`，或任何阻塞调用（`io.*`、`os.execute`、原生 "
"LuaSocket）——会卡住该 worker 上的所有请求。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:190 dd4d8bf6c59b4f469a890a62327e07f0
msgid "Retrying NXDOMAIN, REFUSED, or a missing resolver."
msgstr "重试 NXDOMAIN、REFUSED 或缺少 resolver 的情况。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:191 97b3b739f4da47829d1bda63acadb39e
msgid "Unbounded retries against the same nameservers."
msgstr "对相同的域名服务器进行无上限的重试。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:192 486d00f060f242bd92d86882b4f4a18c
msgid "Using an IP URL for HTTPS without the original name as SNI."
msgstr "在 HTTPS 中使用 IP URL 而不把原始名称作为 SNI。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:193 9c51c9f6041d4e49b6da2d3c6f1b9a05
msgid ""
"Assuming SERVFAIL tries the next nameserver. In this tree it fails the "
"waiters."
msgstr "假设 SERVFAIL 会尝试下一个域名服务器。在本源码树中它会让等待者失败。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:195 d8c3a8a295c245ec8c5ee3db214e511b
msgid "Splicing strings in a hot loop; use `table.concat`."
msgstr "在热循环中用 `..` 拼接字符串；改用 `table.concat`。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:196 a3f7a941888b4f0e898eae27512f9166
msgid ""
"Sharing a cosocket (or a light thread) across requests or into a timer "
"callback."
msgstr "跨请求共享 cosocket（或 light thread），或把它传入定时器回调。"

#: ../../07-conventions.md:199 0746dbed880b45429b96b77fdc21fbe4
